CP carrier."], [5, "meshes/humanoid/RingMetacarpalLobe.stl", [0.89, 0.91, 0.92, 1], "RingMetacarpalLobe", "Rounded palm-side knuckle transition joins the broad metacarpal contour to the corresponding articulated MCP carrier."], [5, "meshes/humanoid/PinkyMetacarpalLobe.stl", [0.89, 0.91, 0.92, 1], "PinkyMetacarpalLobe", "Rounded palm-side knuckle transition joins the broad metacarpal contour to the corresponding articulated MCP carrier."], [5, "meshes/humanoid/ThenarEminence.stl", [0.89, 0.91, 0.92, 1], "ThenarEminence", "The rounded muscular mound at the thumb base creates the asymmetric human palm silhouette and bridges the wrist to the thumb CMC socket. It is a rigid visual/collision envelope, not simulated muscle."], [5, "meshes/humanoid/HypothenarEminence.stl", [0.89, 0.91, 0.92, 1], "HypothenarEminence", "A smaller rounded mound on the little-finger side completes the palm contour and provides a curved support surface."], [5, "meshes/humanoid/CentralPalmPad.stl", [0.31, 0.34, 0.36, 1], "CentralPalmPad", "Oval, softly domed palmar contact insert. Frictional contact is modeled in physics; real elastomer compliance, durometer and attachment are not yet engineered."], [5, "meshes/humanoid/ThenarPad.stl", [0.31, 0.34, 0.36, 1], "ThenarPad", "Curved thumb-base contact insert follows the thenar mound, helping the palm support objects during opposition."], [5, "meshes/humanoid/DorsalPalmPanel.stl", [0.63, 0.67, 0.71, 1], "DorsalPalmPanel", "A thin rounded dorsal service panel follows the back-of-hand contour. Production fasteners and sealing remain to be selected."], [5, "meshes/humanoid/WristSoftSeal.stl", [0.13, 0.16, 0.18, 1], "WristSoftSeal", "Narrow soft transition at the wrist preserves the natural palm taper while making the roll boundary visible."], [6, "meshes/humanoid/indexMCPBall.stl", [0.63, 0.67, 0.71, 1], "indexMCPBall", "Rounded two-axis knuckle carrier supports independent finger spread and flexion at the same MCP center. Bearing/transmission hardware r